      "side": 1,
      "message": "Any reason for not calling the pkvm_firmware_rmem_init() after the if (!enable_pkvm) check? e.g.\n\n```\n        if (!enable_pkvm)\n                return 0;\n\n        ret \u003d pkvm_firmware_rmem_init();\n        if (ret)\n                return ret;\n```",
